# BUOY with -j (first subset only, so the golden is a single valid JSON object): the metreport "type" must be "ZZYY". Before 2026-11-19 parse_subset_as_buoy() did not
# set m->type, so it came out empty in the JSON/CSV/XML outputs (and output filters on the report type,
# such as -S in bufrdb2tacfil, could not match buoy reports).
INPUT=20261118002733_IOBX18_CWAO_180002.bufr
ARGS="-j -S 0..0"
GOLDEN=buoy_json.json
